  <h2>Submit a Request</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:privacy@reviko.io">privacy@reviko.io</a> and include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your full name;</li>
    <li>email address associated with Reviko;</li>
    <li>the Merchant or loyalty program involved, if relevant;</li>
    <li>the type of request;</li>
    <li>enough information for us to reasonably identify the relevant account or data.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Reviko may request additional information to verify identity before fulfilling a request.</p>

  <h2>Available Request Types</h2>
  <p>Depending on applicable law, you may request:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>access;</li>
    <li>correction;</li>
    <li>deletion;</li>
    <li>portability;</li>
    <li>information about disclosures;</li>
    <li>withdrawal of certain consent;</li>
    <li>opt-out rights that apply under state privacy law.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Response</h2>
  <p>Reviko will respond within the time required by applicable law.</p>

